---
// Services-page hero background: a static dark gradient wash, ocean palette, no animation.
// Used to render a real WebGL "Modular Assembly" particle field (src/scripts/servicesHeroWave.ts,
// now removed) at the user's explicit request to take it back out; see CLAUDE.md's "Services page"
// note for the history (SVG orbit -> rejected "Orbiting Constellation" WebGL -> "Modular Assembly"
// WebGL -> removed back to static). If a hero animation is wanted here again, that history is
// worth reading first rather than re-deriving the same options from scratch.
---

<div class="hero-canvas-wrap absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="hero-base-gradient absolute inset-0"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grain opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay"></div>
</div>

<style>
  .hero-base-gradient {
    background:
      radial-gradient(110% 85% at 12% 15%, rgba(74, 111, 165, 0.3), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(90% 70% at 82% 90%, rgba(79, 109, 122, 0.3), transparent 60%),
      #104866;
  }
</style>
